## Desk Studio

This project has a design studio on call. The desks, their briefs, the rubric and the standards live in `.agents/skills/desk/`. The brand lives in `.desk/DESIGN.md` once a job has run, and the user can edit it any time.

For a design ask that ends in files (a card, a carousel, a landing page, an email, a deck, a chart, a clip, a brand kit), run the studio and hand back what it prints:

    npx --package deskstudio desk-run <command> "<the ask>"

Commands: `design` (one still image for a feed, from a brief and the brand). Flags: `--quality studio|best|thrifty`, `--rounds N`, `--models director=anthropic/opus,builder=google/flash`. `npx --package deskstudio desk-run doctor` shows which model providers this machine can use.

The runner writes finished files to `.desk/out/<job>/` and the job state to `.desk/jobs/<job>/`. Its last lines are the handback: what was made and where, which desks worked on which model, the scores, the rounds, the cost. Return that to the user as it is. Exit code 3 means the job is holding (paused from the floor), 4 means it was handed back under the bar.

For design work inside the codebase (components, styles, pages), play the Design Manager yourself: read `.agents/skills/desk/SKILL.md` and follow it, with the role briefs in `.agents/skills/desk/roles/`, `.agents/skills/desk/rubric.md` and the standards in `.agents/skills/desk/standards/`. Desks on call: Accessibility Specialist, AI Audio & Voice Producer, AI Image Director, AI Prompt Engineer, AI Video Director, Art Director, Brand Strategist, Compliance Designer, Content Designer, Conversational Designer, Copy Editor, Creative Director, Dashboard Architect, Data Viz Designer, Design Engineer, Design Manager, Design System Lead, Editorial Designer, Email Copywriter, Email Designer, Framework Specialist, Growth/Analytics Specialist, Icon Designer, Illustration Director, Image Editor, Interaction Designer, Landing Page Designer, Motion Designer, Presentation Designer, Print Designer, Product Designer, Social Media Copywriter, Social Media Designer, Social Media Strategist, Spatial Designer, Storyboard Artist, Typographer, UI Designer, UX Designer, UX Researcher, Video/Content Producer, Video Editor. Run proof on anything visual with `npx --package deskstudio desk-proof check <file> --brand .desk/DESIGN.md --sizes <sizes> --out .desk/renders`.
